Privacy Note:

All IP addresses in this dataset have been replaced with deterministic
SHA256 cryptographic hashes. No raw IP addresses, packet payloads, or
personally identifiable information are present in any released file.
This dataset contains only Layer 3/4 flow-level metadata.
